Subject: Rank Developer Knowledge first for GKE facts

Why: upstream ranks only the interfaces for live cluster operations, so a GKE fact the agent needs (a field, a version lifecycle, a quota) falls through to web search. This repository ranks Developer Knowledge first for those lookups and web search as the fallback, in cli-reference.md and in the Reference Directory entries that describe it and mcp-usage.md.
